{"type":"standard","title":"Amy Klobuchar","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Amy Klobuchar</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q22237","titles":{"canonical":"Amy_Klobuchar","normalized":"Amy Klobuchar","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Amy Klobuchar</span></span>"},"pageid":1596343,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b7/Amy_Klobuchar%2C_official_portrait%2C_113th_Congress.jpg/330px-Amy_Klobuchar%2C_official_portrait%2C_113th_Congress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":413},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b7/Amy_Klobuchar%2C_official_portrait%2C_113th_Congress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":3840,"height":4800},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1377911492","tid":"5cac7b3b-bdea-11f1-b8fa-0e7d26eb7793","timestamp":"2026-10-01T22:49:30Z","description":"American politician and lawyer (born 1960)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amy_Klobuchar","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amy_Klobuchar?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amy_Klobuchar?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Amy_Klobuchar"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amy_Klobuchar","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Amy_Klobuchar","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amy_Klobuchar?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Amy_Klobuchar"}},"extract":"Amy Jean Klobuchar is an American politician and lawyer serving as the senior United States senator from Minnesota, a seat she has held since 2007. A member of the Minnesota Democratic–Farmer–Labor Party (DFL), Minnesota's affiliate of the Democratic Party, she served from 1999 to 2007 as county attorney of Hennepin County, Minnesota. She is the Democratic nominee in the 2026 Minnesota gubernatorial election.","extract_html":"<p><b>Amy Jean Klobuchar</b> is an American politician and lawyer serving as the senior United States senator from Minnesota, a seat she has held since 2007. A member of the Minnesota Democratic–Farmer–Labor Party (DFL), Minnesota's affiliate of the Democratic Party, she served from 1999 to 2007 as county attorney of Hennepin County, Minnesota. She is the Democratic nominee in the 2026 Minnesota gubernatorial election.</p>"}